<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; color: #374151;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h2 style="color: #4f46e5; margin: 0;">AES Fire Inspections</h2>
  </div>

  <p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

  <p>Someone has requested a link to change your password. You can do this through the link below.</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
    <%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), style: "background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;" %>
  </div>

  <p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
  <p>Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center;">
    &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> AES Fire Inspections. All rights reserved.
  </p>
</div>
